    narr:narration """Dave Quantum [announced a migration](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787736270121_1) of the analytics pipeline from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB on August 26, 2026. The shift is framed through a [dual-justification of performance and cost](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787736270121_2), citing a projected 10x gain in analytical query speed. The communication style is highly structured, utilizing [parallel bulleted summaries](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787736270121_3) to codify the [technical decision](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787736270121_3), [performance outcomes](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787736270121_4), and [Q3 2026 timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787736270121_5). The voice profile remains consistently authoritative and matter-of-fact, moving from an initial activated announcement to a settled, calm presentation of the migration roadmap.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787736270121_1> ;
